# The ownership manifests are generated digest proofs: every field is derived
# from the sources, so merging their text is meaningless — two branches always
# disagree on source_digest and on every sha256 a regeneration touched. The
# `lup-ownership` driver keeps one side so the merge resolves, and the next
# `lup-devtools harness generate` settles the digests against the merged tree.
#
# The driver is per-clone git config, which no repository can ship. Register it
# with `lup-devtools dev merge-driver`; without it git falls back to the text
# merge and these files conflict as they did before.
.claude/.lup-ownership.json merge=lup-ownership
.codex/.lup-ownership.json merge=lup-ownership
